<p data-v-039ffd48="" class="para">Watch the KION online cinema: original films and series, blockbuster library, cartoons and TV. <br><br>Sign up for a subscription with a huge variety of content that is added every day.<br><br>The KION app is:<br><br>- user-friendly interface<br>- smart recommendation system<br>- children's profile with safe content<br>- simultaneous viewing on 5 devices<br>- Full HD 4K quality<br><br>KION: all content in one subscription<br><br>- Original TV series and films of our own production ("Khrustalny", "Klinika schast'ya", "Kosa" and others)<br>- Huge library of foreign and Russian films, TV series and cartoons<br>- World premieres by release date<br>- 180+ TV channels: sports, news, films, music and much more<br>- LIVE concerts, live broadcasts of matches and major world events<br><br>KION TOP: a subscription for real moviegoers<br><br>3 online cinemas in one subscription: KION, Amediateka, ivi<br> <br>The service is available on phones, tablets, computers, SMART TV and Android/Apple TV set-top boxes. Start watching on the website or TV and continue using your smartphone or tablet on the go.<br> <br>The application is available for all mobile operators. For MTS subscribers, there is a special offer, according to which traffic for watching videos in the KION application on a mobile device is not charged</p>